@startuml Sequence_A_Main
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Bank Core" as Core
participant "Notification API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Outbox Relay" as Relay
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Temporal Starter" as Starter
participant "Temporal Workflow" as WF
participant "Push Activity" as Push
participant "FCM / APNs" as Provider
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Callback API" as Callback

Core -> API: POST critical event + idempotency_key
API -> DB: BEGIN; INSERT notification/inbox/outbox
DB --> API: COMMIT
API --> Core: 202 Accepted + notification_id
Relay -> DB: Read unpublished outbox
Relay -> Kafka: Publish transactional event
Kafka --> Starter: Consume event
Starter -> WF: Start Workflow(notification_id)
WF -> DB: Load notification and preferences snapshot
WF -> Push: Send push(attempt_id, notification_id)
Push -> Provider: Submit push
Provider --> Push: Accepted + provider_message_id
Push -> DB: Persist ACCEPTED_BY_PROVIDER
WF -> WF: Start durable timer (8 seconds)
Provider -> App: Deliver push (best effort)
App -> Callback: App ACK(notification_id, device_id)
Callback -> WF: Signal AppAcknowledged
WF -> DB: Set DEVICE_ACKNOWLEDGED; append event
WF --> Core: Workflow completed (delivery confirmed at app)
@enduml
